# Every response, the app's and the files'. Notebook code runs on the site's
# origin (see "Trust and security" in PLAN.md), so a permission the visitor
# grants for one notebook would hold for all of them: Permissions-Policy
# turns off the powerful features notebooks have no business using. Not
# fullscreen, which slides and some outputs use. Not bluetooth either: no
# browser takes it as a policy yet, and Chrome warns about it on every page.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), display-capture=(), midi=(), usb=(), serial=(), hid=(), payment=()
